cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use equationnet, please cite it as below."
title: "equationnet"
abstract: >-
  Type a differential equation and give it your data. equationnet trains six
  simple models: three that use the equation and three data-only baselines. It
  ranks them by their error on points they never saw, and gives you each model
  as a standalone script. You can add models of your own to the comparison.
type: software
authors:
